# The full Windows 98 icon library (~2,400 files) is kept locally for browsing
# but not committed. Only the icons the site actually uses are tracked, in
# Images/icons/.
#
# To use a new icon: copy it from Images/win98_icons/png/ into Images/icons/
# and point at that path. If you forget the copy, it breaks locally straight
# away rather than silently 404ing on the live site.
Images/win98_icons/

# OS and editor junk. The icon ZIP arrived carrying ~2,400 of these.
.DS_Store
._*
__MACOSX/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
.vscode/
